# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is re-included here.
# This keeps secrets, VCS data and local state out of every image layer.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!**/*.py

# Exclusions below the allowlist win over the re-includes above.
# A local virtualenv is rebuilt from uv.lock, never copied.
.venv/
# Tests are not needed to build the application.
tests/
